WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.921 --> 00:00:16.044
Zann flinched as he heard the splash of Venna hitting the water.

2
00:00:16.844 --> 00:00:20.285
But he didn't dare move, not even to look over the edge of the cliff.

3
00:00:20.785 --> 00:00:22.085
Morb was still nearby.

4
00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:25.026
"Good riddance," Morb muttered.

5
00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:28.267
He snapped his fingers and zapped out of sight.

6
00:00:28.287 --> 00:00:29.668
"Come on."

7
00:00:29.848 --> 00:00:31.008
Perda rushed to the edge.

8
00:00:31.568 --> 00:00:33.369
"Maybe there's time to save Venna!"

9
00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:37.010
Zann ran over and looked down at the dark water.

10
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.650
Then he noticed Wyssa rubbing her fingers together.

11
00:00:41.451 --> 00:00:44.131
He guessed she was about to zap away to find Morb.

12
00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:47.252
"Wait!" He ran to her and grabbed her arm.

13
00:00:47.272 --> 00:00:50.293
"Please. You have to help Venna."

14
00:00:51.433 --> 00:00:54.654
"You help her if you like," Wyssa said harshly.

15
00:00:54.674 --> 00:00:57.215
"I have more pressing business."

16
00:00:57.235 --> 00:01:00.456
"But she was Morb's prisoner, right?"

17
00:01:00.596 --> 00:01:01.216
Darb put in.

18
00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.041
"Maybe she can tell us more about his plans."

19
00:01:05.062 --> 00:01:07.263
Now Wyssa looked much more interested.

20
00:01:07.283 --> 00:01:09.564
"Hmm," she said.

21
00:01:10.385 --> 00:01:12.786
Suddenly everyone heard a splash from below.

22
00:01:13.626 --> 00:01:15.568
Venna had popped to the surface of the water.

23
00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:18.049
She was slimy and breathless.

24
00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:22.531
"Help!" she cried as she desperately treaded water.

25
00:01:22.551 --> 00:01:24.172
"Hold on!"

26
00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:25.553
Perda called down to Venna.

27
00:01:26.193 --> 00:01:27.114
She turned to Wyssa.

28
00:01:27.134 --> 00:01:30.596
"Hurry—before the gulper changes its mind."

29
00:01:31.496 --> 00:01:32.536
Wyssa waved a hand.

30
00:01:33.377 --> 00:01:38.278
Venna levitated out of the gorge and landed beside the group, shaking and coughing.

31
00:01:39.078 --> 00:01:41.059
"How did she escape from the gulper?"

32
00:01:41.259 --> 00:01:41.879
Gliss asked.

33
00:01:41.899 --> 00:01:45.800
"Venna must still be under the Dousing spell," said Darb.

34
00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.921
"Maybe the gulper spit her out when it realized she didn't have any magic."

35
00:01:49.941 --> 00:01:53.322
"Are you under a Dousing spell, Venna?"

36
00:01:53.602 --> 00:01:55.022
Wyssa waved her hand again.

37
00:01:55.883 --> 00:01:58.863
A buzz of magic energy surrounded Venna for a moment.

38
00:01:58.883 --> 00:02:01.104
"Oh!" said Venna.

39
00:02:01.516 --> 00:02:04.118
"Did you She rubbed her hands together.

40
00:02:04.479 --> 00:02:06.780
Instantly her clothes and hair were dry.

41
00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.362
"Thank you!"

42
00:02:08.622 --> 00:02:09.062
she cried.

43
00:02:09.082 --> 00:02:12.145
"It feels so good to have magic again."

44
00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:14.967
"I can't believe you're here!"

45
00:02:15.187 --> 00:02:15.688
Perda said.

46
00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:17.930
"How did you end up with Morb?"

47
00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:19.611
Venna shuddered.

48
00:02:19.631 --> 00:02:23.874
"Morb," she spat, already seeming more like her old self.

49
00:02:24.715 --> 00:02:25.476
"Where did he go?

50
00:02:26.036 --> 00:02:28.258
We must stop his evil plans!"

51
00:02:29.239 --> 00:02:30.300
Zann stepped forward.

52
00:02:30.584 --> 00:02:32.185
"Do you know if he found my parents?

53
00:02:33.026 --> 00:02:34.467
We heard he was looking for them."

54
00:02:35.748 --> 00:02:36.849
"Nax and Asta?"

55
00:02:37.149 --> 00:02:38.250
Venna looked surprised.

56
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:42.073
"No, as far as I know I was his only Magician prisoner.

57
00:02:42.754 --> 00:02:45.556
Besides, I thought your parents disappeared years ago."

58
00:02:46.477 --> 00:02:47.818
Zann's shoulders slumped.

59
00:02:48.178 --> 00:02:50.900
Had he reached another dead end in the search for his parents?

60
00:02:51.681 --> 00:02:53.122
Wyssa leaned toward Venna.

61
00:02:53.142 --> 00:02:58.066
"You mentioned Morb's plans—did he tell you what he's trying to do?"

62
00:02:59.487 --> 00:03:00.168
Venna nodded.

63
00:03:00.516 --> 00:03:05.020
"For the past couple of days, Morb has been searching for the Horn of the Otherworld."

64
00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:08.323
"Huh?" Zann traded a look with his friends.

65
00:03:09.103 --> 00:03:13.887
The Horn of the Otherworld was the relic Teplo had been holding right before the Cave of the

66
00:03:13.967 --> 00:03:14.948
Unknown collapsed.

67
00:03:15.749 --> 00:03:17.690
"The Horn of the Otherworld?"

68
00:03:17.891 --> 00:03:18.571
Gliss frowned.

69
00:03:18.591 --> 00:03:21.374
"Why does Morb want that?"

70
00:03:22.775 --> 00:03:23.495
Venna shrugged.

71
00:03:23.515 --> 00:03:24.676
"He wouldn't tell me.

72
00:03:25.137 --> 00:03:28.860
All I know is that the Horn wasn't where he expected to find it.

73
00:03:29.768 --> 00:03:34.130
So he traced its magical essence, which led him to me."

74
00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.412
"You?" Wyssa raised an eyebrow.

75
00:03:37.432 --> 00:03:41.253
"Why?" "Because I'd touched it recently."

76
00:03:41.533 --> 00:03:42.194
Venna grimaced.

77
00:03:42.214 --> 00:03:49.377
"And because I was in a Doused state—that made it much easier for Morb to control me than

78
00:03:49.457 --> 00:03:51.278
someone like Tok or Teplo."

79
00:03:51.298 --> 00:03:53.659
"I see," Zann said.

80
00:03:53.679 --> 00:03:56.020
"So Morb found you in the vortex?"

81
00:03:56.788 --> 00:03:59.069
"Yes. I suppose I should be grateful."

82
00:03:59.429 --> 00:04:00.450
Venna grimaced again.

83
00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:06.552
"If Morb hadn't grabbed me, I wouldn't have survived the vortex much longer without magic."

84
00:04:06.572 --> 00:04:11.634
"I bet Morb wants to try to take over Magica again," Perda said.

85
00:04:11.654 --> 00:04:15.556
"Maybe with another crazy contraption from the Old Times."

86
00:04:16.896 --> 00:04:18.077
"I'm sure you're right."

87
00:04:18.377 --> 00:04:19.457
Venna sounded worried.

88
00:04:20.298 --> 00:04:24.479
"I only wish I had access to the ancient texts so I could try to figure out what

89
00:04:24.519 --> 00:04:25.460
he has in mind."

90
00:04:26.304 --> 00:04:29.905
"Did Morb feed you to the gulper because you wouldn't tell him where the Horn is?"

91
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:30.785
Darb asked.

92
00:04:31.726 --> 00:04:32.566
"Not exactly.

93
00:04:33.026 --> 00:04:34.886
I did resist for some time.

94
00:04:35.667 --> 00:04:37.667
But Morb finally got impatient."

95
00:04:38.007 --> 00:04:38.707
Venna shuddered.

96
00:04:38.727 --> 00:04:42.328
"He forced me to tell by using a Possession spell."

97
00:04:43.389 --> 00:04:46.990
"That spell uses a lot of energy," Wyssa said.

98
00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.110
"I know," Venna said.

99
00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:52.691
"I suppose that's why he didn't use it as soon as he grabbed me."

100
00:04:53.491 --> 00:04:55.092
She rubbed her chin thoughtfully.

101
00:04:55.520 --> 00:05:00.701
"If we could find Morb now, he might be in a weakened state."

102
00:05:00.721 --> 00:05:04.482
"It could be our best chance," Wyssa agreed.

103
00:05:05.203 --> 00:05:06.103
"Where is the relic?

104
00:05:06.443 --> 00:05:08.543
We must reach it before he does."

105
00:05:09.904 --> 00:05:11.444
Venna opened her mouth to answer.

106
00:05:11.884 --> 00:05:14.705
But at that moment, Perda let out a sharp cry.

107
00:05:15.885 --> 00:05:18.486
Then she crumpled to the ground, unconscious.

108
00:05:18.506 --> 00:05:22.107
"Perda!" Zann exclaimed, kneeling by her side.

109
00:05:22.127 --> 00:05:24.068
"What's wrong with her?"

110
00:05:24.268 --> 00:05:25.288
Gliss sounded scared.

111
00:05:26.296 --> 00:05:27.377
"Let me through."

112
00:05:27.717 --> 00:05:29.018
Wyssa pushed past the kids.

113
00:05:29.758 --> 00:05:32.439
She touched Perda's face and then murmured a few words.

114
00:05:32.459 --> 00:05:35.721
"Awaken," she added, snapping her fingers.

115
00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:38.202
Perda blinked and sat up.

116
00:05:39.083 --> 00:05:40.484
"Whoa," she mumbled.

117
00:05:40.904 --> 00:05:42.044
"That was weird!"

118
00:05:42.065 --> 00:05:43.645
"What happened?"

119
00:05:43.966 --> 00:05:44.586
Zann asked.

120
00:05:45.226 --> 00:05:46.167
Perda stared at him.

121
00:05:46.607 --> 00:05:48.088
"I saw them," she said.

122
00:05:48.108 --> 00:05:49.448
"Your parents.

123
00:05:50.469 --> 00:05:53.671
I recognized them from the hologram we saw in the Cave."

124
00:05:53.691 --> 00:05:55.912
"What?" Zann exclaimed.

125
00:05:56.332 --> 00:05:58.533
"What do you mean, you saw my parents?"

126
00:05:59.613 --> 00:06:00.233
Perda shrugged.

127
00:06:00.253 --> 00:06:05.034
"It was a super strong vision—like a really vivid dream."

128
00:06:05.054 --> 00:06:07.195
"But what caused it?"

129
00:06:07.415 --> 00:06:07.995
Gliss wondered.

130
00:06:08.015 --> 00:06:10.436
"None of the rest of us saw anything."

131
00:06:10.456 --> 00:06:12.136
"I don't know."

132
00:06:12.436 --> 00:06:14.237
Then Perda's eyes widened.

133
00:06:15.137 --> 00:06:16.598
"Wait, yes I do!

134
00:06:17.258 --> 00:06:20.999
I put my hand in my pocket and touched Zann's message stone.

135
00:06:21.999 --> 00:06:23.119
See?" She pointed.

136
00:06:23.139 --> 00:06:25.380
"It fell there, on the ground.

137
00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.361
It must have caused the vision!"

138
00:06:27.381 --> 00:06:29.462
"Let me try!"

139
00:06:30.362 --> 00:06:35.125
Zann grabbed the stone and was almost knocked off his feet by a strong vision of his parents.

140
00:06:36.305 --> 00:06:38.887
He could see them more clearly than ever before.

141
00:06:39.687 --> 00:06:41.808
They were standing in a dimly lit room.

142
00:06:42.649 --> 00:06:44.710
A tiny Roodian woman was with them.

143
00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:47.911
All three of them looked terrified!
